  "2061": {
    "user_side_comment": "Disable maskable IRQ interrupts",
    "user_line_comment": "=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\nProgram entry point: disables IRQs, initializes the border-color state index,\nand runs an infinite frame-sync loop polling raster line $FF to dispatch the\nactive state handler once per video frame.\n\nInputs:  None\nOutputs: zp_border_state = STATE_BORDER_RED (0) initially; A, X, P modified in loop\nSide Effects: Disables maskable IRQs (SEI), busy-waits on VIC-II $D012 for\n              scanline $FF -> $100 transition, and invokes the state-machine\n              dispatcher each frame (infinite loop; never returns)\n=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-="
  },
  "2062": {
    "user_side_comment": "Initial state 0 (red border)",
    "enum_usage": "BorderState"
  },
