    "user_side_comment": "Repeat for next video frame"
  },
  "2084": {
    "user_side_comment": "Load active border-color state index (0..=2)",
    "user_line_comment": "=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\nDispatches the active border-color state handler via a split Lo/Hi RTS jump\ntable (PHA / PHA / RTS) indexed by zp_border_state.\n\nInputs:  zp_border_state = active border-color state index (0..=2)\nOutputs: X = zp_border_state; A = <(handler - 1); N, Z flags modified (plus outputs of\n         the tail-called state handler)\nSide Effects: Pushes 16-bit (handler - 1) onto the stack and transfers\n              control via RTS to state_0_border_red ($0835),\n              state_1_border_green ($083F), or state_2_border_blue ($0849),\n              which returns directly to the JSR caller ($0821)\n=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-="
  },
